Input: {"question": "Which organization, club or musical group is Nals a member of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 217, "text": "As I wandered through the cobblestone streets of Nals, the picturesque municipality in South Tyrol, Italy, I stumbled upon a small, unassuming building tucked away between the medieval town hall and the parish church."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 218, "end": 355, "text": "The faded sign above the door read \"Accademia Nalense\" in elegant script, and I couldn't help but feel a sense of curiosity wash over me."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 356, "end": 443, "text": "I pushed open the door, and a warm light spilled out, illuminating the quiet afternoon."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 444, "end": 584, "text": "Inside, I found myself in a cozy, wood-paneled room filled with rows of dusty bookshelves and a scattering of worn, leather-bound armchairs."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 585, "end": 666, "text": "The air was thick with the scent of old parchment and the faint hint of espresso."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 667, "end": 821, "text": "A bespectacled woman with a kind smile and a wild shock of curly hair looked up from behind a desk, where she was intently studying a yellowed manuscript."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 822, "end": 880, "text": "\"Buongiorno,\" she said, her eyes crinkling at the corners."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 881, "end": 915, "text": "\"Welcome to the Accademia Nalense."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 916, "end": 923, "text": "I'm Dr."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 924, "end": 958, "text": "Elisabetta Moretti, the director.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 959, "end": 1139, "text": "As we chatted, I learned that the Accademia Nalense was a hub for scholars and researchers from across Europe, drawn to Nals by its unique blend of Italian and Austrian influences."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1140, "end": 1143, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1144, "end": 1314, "text": "Moretti spoke with infectious enthusiasm about the academy's mission to foster cross-cultural understanding and collaboration, and I found myself swept up in her passion."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1315, "end": 1372, "text": "As we sipped coffee and nibbled on delicate pastries, Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1373, "end": 1581, "text": "Moretti mentioned, almost in passing, that the Accademia Nalense was proud to be a member of the esteemed Academia Europaea, a pan-European academy dedicated to promoting excellence in research and education."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1582, "end": 1638, "text": "I felt a thrill of excitement at the connection, and Dr."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1639, "end": 1664, "text": "Moretti smiled knowingly."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1665, "end": 1685, "text": "\"Ah, yes,\" she said."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1686, "end": 1725, "text": "\"We're rather proud of our affiliation."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1726, "end": 1827, "text": "It's a testament to the power of collaboration and the pursuit of knowledge that transcends borders.\""}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1828, "end": 1855, "text": "As I prepared to leave, Dr."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1856, "end": 1916, "text": "Moretti pressed a small, leather-bound volume into my hands."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1917, "end": 1936, "text": "\"A gift,\" she said."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1937, "end": 2045, "text": "\"A collection of essays by our members, exploring the intersection of culture and identity in modern Europe."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2046, "end": 2082, "text": "I think you'll find it fascinating.\""}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2083, "end": 2269, "text": "As I walked back through the streets of Nals, the volume tucked under my arm, I couldn't help but feel a sense of connection to this charming municipality and its rich cultural heritage."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "Title: The Green Heart of South Tyrol: Nals' Commitment to a Sustainable Future"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 81, "end": 197, "text": "In the picturesque municipality of Nals, nestled in the heart of South Tyrol, Italy, a quiet revolution is underway."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 198, "end": 431, "text": "Amidst the rolling hills and snow-capped mountains, the residents of Nals have made a conscious decision to prioritize the health of the planet, joining forces with the Climate Alliance to combat the pressing issue of climate change."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 432, "end": 644, "text": "As we delve into the story of Nals, it becomes clear that this small town's commitment to sustainability is not just a passing fad, but a deeply ingrained philosophy that permeates every aspect of community life."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 645, "end": 894, "text": "From the town's historic center, where ancient buildings seem to whisper tales of the past, to the lush green forests that surround it, Nals is a municipality that wears its heart on its sleeve – a heart that beats in harmony with the natural world."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 895, "end": 1093, "text": "The Climate Alliance, a European organization dedicated to promoting sustainable development and reducing greenhouse gas emissions, has been a driving force behind Nals' eco-friendly transformation."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1094, "end": 1285, "text": "As a member of this esteemed organization, Nals has pledged to reduce its carbon footprint, investing in renewable energy sources, sustainable transportation, and eco-friendly infrastructure."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1286, "end": 1406, "text": "One of the most striking examples of Nals' commitment to sustainability is its innovative approach to energy production."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1407, "end": 1536, "text": "The town has invested heavily in solar power, with photovoltaic panels adorning rooftops and solar farms dotting the countryside."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1537, "end": 1725, "text": "This clean energy initiative has not only reduced Nals' reliance on fossil fuels but has also created a new revenue stream for local residents, who can sell excess energy back to the grid."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1726, "end": 1815, "text": "But Nals' dedication to sustainability extends far beyond the realm of energy production."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1816, "end": 1952, "text": "The town's transportation system has undergone a radical overhaul, with electric and hybrid vehicles replacing traditional gas-guzzlers."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1953, "end": 2132, "text": "The introduction of bike-sharing schemes and pedestrian-friendly infrastructure has encouraged residents to ditch their cars, reducing congestion and air pollution in the process."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2133, "end": 2225, "text": "The town's commitment to sustainability is also reflected in its waste management practices."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2226, "end": 2348, "text": "Nals has implemented a comprehensive recycling program, with residents encouraged to separate organic and inorganic waste."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2349, "end": 2502, "text": "This initiative has resulted in a significant reduction in waste sent to landfills, with the town aiming to achieve zero waste status in the near future."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2503, "end": 2700, "text": "Nals' partnership with the Climate Alliance has also facilitated the development of eco-friendly infrastructure, including green roofs, rainwater harvesting systems, and sustainable urban planning."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Accademia Nalense", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Nals is a member of the Accademia Nalense.", "answer": "Accademia Nalense", "quote": "The faded sign above the door read \"Accademia Nalense\" in elegant script, and I couldn't help but feel a sense of curiosity wash over me. I pushed open the door, and a warm light spilled out, illuminating the quiet afternoon. Inside, I found myself in a cozy, wood-paneled room filled with rows of dusty bookshelves and a scattering of worn, leather-bound armchairs. The air was thick with the scent of old parchment and the faint hint of espresso. A bespectacled woman with a kind smile and a wild shock of curly hair looked up from behind a desk, where she was intently studying a yellowed manuscript. \"Buongiorno,\" she said, her eyes crinkling at the corners. \"Welcome to the Accademia Nalense. I'm Dr. Elisabetta Moretti, the director.\" As we chatted, I learned that the Accademia Nalense was a hub for scholars and researchers from across Europe, drawn to Nals by its unique blend of Italian and Austrian influences.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Academia Europaea", "scope": "organization", "claim": "The Accademia Nalense is a member of the Academia Europaea.", "answer": "Academia Europaea", "quote": "Moretti mentioned, almost in passing, that the Accademia Nalense was proud to be a member of the esteemed Academia Europaea, a pan-European academy dedicated to promoting excellence in research and education.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Nals", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Nals is a member of the Climate Alliance.", "answer": "Climate Alliance", "quote": "Amidst the rolling hills and snow-capped mountains, the residents of Nals have made a conscious decision to prioritize the health of the planet, joining forces with the Climate Alliance to combat the pressing issue of climate change. As we delve into the story of Nals, it becomes clear that this small town's commitment to sustainability is not just a passing fad, but a deeply ingrained philosophy that permeates every aspect of community life. From the town's historic center, where ancient buildings seem to whisper tales of the past, to the lush green forests that surround it, Nals is a municipality that wears its heart on its sleeve – a heart that beats in harmony with the natural world. The Climate Alliance, a European organization dedicated to promoting sustainable development and reducing greenhouse gas emissions, has been a driving force behind Nals' eco-friendly transformation. As a member of this esteemed organization, Nals has pledged to reduce its carbon footprint, investing in renewable energy sources, sustainable transportation, and eco-friendly infrastructure.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Accademia Nalense", "Climate Alliance", "Academia Europaea"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Accademia Nalense", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Climate Alliance", "origin": "initial"}, 